    user_response: "Apply the \"Bento Grid\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bento Grid\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#F3F4F1] text-[#1A1A1A] p-8 flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden\'> <header class=\'flex justify-between items-end mb-6\'> <div> <h1 class=\'text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-none uppercase italic\'>Kyoto, Japan</h1> <p class=\'text-lg font-medium opacity-60 tracking-tight mt-1 underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4\'>4-Day Smart Itinerary / Solo Traveler / Moderate Budget</p> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-4\'> <div class=\'border-2 border-[#1A1A1A] bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#1A1A1A]\'> <span class=\'text-xs font-bold block opacity-50 uppercase\'>Tempo</span> <span class=\'text-xl font-bold\'>Balanced</span> </div> <div class=\'border-2 border-[#1A1A1A] bg-[#C5E876] px-4 py-2 rounded-xl shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_#1A1A1A]\'> <span class=\'text-xs font-bold block opacity-50 uppercase\'>Status</span> <span class=\'text-xl font-bold italic\'>Optimized</span> </div> </div> </header> <div class=\'grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-6 gap-6 flex-grow\'> <div class=\'col-span-8 row-span-2 border-2 border-[#1A1A1A] bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#1A1A1A] relative overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'absolute top-4 right-6 text-xs font-black opacity-10 text-8xl leading-none uppercase\'>Vibe</div> <h2 class=\'text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\'><span class=\'w-2 h-2 bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-full\'></span> Trip Summary</h2> <p class=\'text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4\'>The Zen & Modernity Fusion. A harmonious blend of ancient Shinto shrines, bamboo paths, and neon-lit food alleys.</p> <p class=\'text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-70 max-w-2xl font-medium italic\'>Strategy: Allocation prioritized for high-quality Kaiseki dining and private temple access, while using public transit for local travel.</p> </div> <div class=\'col-span-4 row-span-2 border-2 border-[#1A1A1A] bg-[#FFD4D4] rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#1A1A1A]\'> <h2 class=\'text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\'>Estimated Costs</h2> <div class=\'space-y-4\'> <div class=\'flex justify-between items-end border-b-2 border-[#1A1A1A] border-dashed pb-2\'> <span class=\'text-sm font-bold opacity-60 uppercase\'>Daily Total</span> <span class=\'text-2xl font-black\'>$240 <small class=\'text-xs opacity-50\'>USD</small></span> </div> <div class=\'flex justify-between items-center text-sm font-bold\'> <span>Activities</span> <span>$85</span> </div> <div class=\'flex justify-between items-center text-sm font-bold\'> <span>Food/Dining</span> <span>$120</span> </div> <div class=\'mt-4 p-3 bg-white/50 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium leading-tight italic border border-[#1A1A1A]/10\'> Note: Regional tourist tax included. Keep 5000 JPY in cash for small shrine donation boxes. </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'col-span-4 row-span-4 border-2 border-[#1A1A1A] bg-[#89CFF0] rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#1A1A1A]\'> <h2 class=\'text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-6\'>Local Logistics</h2> <div class=\'space-y-6\'> <div> <p class=\'text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 mb-1\'>Best Transit</p> <p class=\'text-lg font-bold leading-tight\'>ICOCA Card + Toei Subway. Walking is essential in Gion district.</p> </div> <div class=\'space-y-3\'> <p class=\'text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 mb-1\'>Cultural Etiquette</p> <ul class=\'text-sm space-y-2\'> <li class=\'flex gap-2 items-start\'><span class=\'text-blue-700\'>\342\200\242</span> <b>Shoes:</b> Always remove when entering temples/traditional inns.</li> <li class=\'flex gap-2 items-start\'><span class=\'text-blue-700\'>\342\200\242</span> <b>Volume:</b> Maintain low voices on public transport.</li> <li class=\'flex gap-2 items-start\'><span class=\'text-blue-700\'>\342\200\242</span> <b>Photos:</b> Ask before photographing Geiko/Maiko.</li> </ul> </div> <div class=\'pt-4 border-t-2 border-[#1A1A1A]/10\'> <p class=\'text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-60 mb-2\'>Packing Essentials</p> <div class=\'flex flex-wrap gap-2\'> <span class=\'px-2 py-1 bg-white text-[10px] font-black uppercase border border-[#1A1A1A] rounded\'>Slip-on Shoes</span> <span class=\'px-2 py-1 bg-white text-[10px] font-black uppercase border border-[#1A1A1A] rounded\'>Power Bank</span> <span class=\'px-2 py-1 bg-white text-[10px] font-black uppercase border border-[#1A1A1A] rounded\'>Hand Fan</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'col-span-8 row-span-4 border-2 border-[#1A1A1A] bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#1A1A1A] flex flex-col\'> <div class=\'flex justify-between items-center mb-8\'> <h2 class=\'text-4xl font-black italic uppercase tracking-tighter\'>Day 01: Arashiyama Morning</h2> <span class=\'px-4 py-1 bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white rounded-full text-xs font-bold\'>HIGASHIYAMA REGION</span> </div> <div class=\'space-y-8 flex-grow\'> <div class=\'flex gap-6 items-start\'> <div class=\'w-24 text-center\'> <span class=\'text-xs font-bold opacity-40 uppercase block\'>08:00 AM</span> <span class=\'text-xs font-black text-red-500\'>FREE</span> </div> <div class=\'flex-grow border-l-4 border-[#C5E876] pl-6\'> <h3 class=\'text-xl font-extrabold mb-1\'>Bamboo Grove Sunrise Walk</h3> <p class=\'text-sm opacity-60 mb-2\'>Beat the tourist rush through the Sagano path. The sound of bamboo stalks swaying is an \'acoustical wonder\'.</p> <div class=\'bg-[#F3F4F1] p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#1A1A1A]/5 text-xs\'> <b class=\'uppercase text-[10px]\'>Insider Tip:</b> Arrive by 7:15 AM to capture photos without crowds at the famous bend. </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-6 items-start\'> <div class=\'w-24 text-center\'> <span class=\'text-xs font-bold opacity-40 uppercase block\'>11:30 AM</span> <span class=\'text-xs font-black\'>$$</span> </div> <div class=\'flex-grow border-l-4 border-[#89CFF0] pl-6\'> <h3 class=\'text-xl font-extrabold mb-1\'>Tenryu-ji Zen Temple Lunch</h3> <p class=\'text-sm opacity-60 mb-2\'>Savor traditional Shojin-ryori (monk\'s vegetarian cuisine) overlooking Sogenchi pond garden.</p> <div class=\'bg-[#F3F4F1] p-3 rounded-xl border border-[#1A1A1A]/5 text-xs\'> <b class=\'uppercase text-[10px]\'>Insider Tip:</b> Reservation at \'Shigetsu\' is required 3 days in advance. </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-6 items-start opacity-40\'> <div class=\'w-24 text-center\'> <span class=\'text-xs font-bold uppercase block\'>06:00 PM</span> <span class=\'text-xs font-black\'>$$$</span> </div> <div class=\'flex-grow border-l-4 border-gray-300 pl-6\'> <h3 class=\'text-xl font-extrabold mb-1\'>Pontocho Alley Exploration</h3> <p class=\'text-sm mb-2\'>Narrow stone-paved street with heritage wooden townhouses (machiya).</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'mt-4 flex justify-between items-center bg-[#F3F4F1] px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-[#1A1A1A]/10\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-black uppercase\'>Transit Check:</span> <span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold\'>24 min via Randen Line (Tram) \342\200\242 1.4km walking estimated</span> </div> </div> </div> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
