  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved the temporary model availability and generation error handling across the application:\n\n- **Resilient AI Calling & Fallbacks**: Integrated automatic exponential retry and seamless fallback support across Gemini models (`gemini-3.7-flash`, `gemini-flash-latest`, `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`) on the backend server to automatically handle transient 503 high demand or 429 rate limit events.\n- **Friendly Error Formatting**: Replaced raw nested JSON error responses with clear, human-readable status messaging.\n- **Interactive Recovery in Error Banner**: Added an inline **\"Retry Generation\"** button and quick sample preset loader buttons to the notification banner so you can immediately re-trigger or browse itineraries without losing form state."
