  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Currency Implementation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing INR (\342\202\271) as the primary currency. My plan involves modifying the `server.ts` file. Specifically, I\'m adjusting the system instruction to ensure all calculations and presentations are done in INR with a realistic tone. This is the latest iteration in the prompt; to reinforce INR calculations and presentation.\n\n\n**Refining User Interface**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on UI simplification, driven by a goal to enhance accessibility. My focus is on eliminating tech-heavy export options, replacing them with a single \"Print/Save as PDF\" button. I\'m also planning a UI overhaul with cleaner design and standard Indian number formatting for all prices displayed in INR. Presets and budget selections will use the INR currency range. The overall goal is to enhance user experience and better suit users across all technical skill levels.\n\n\n**Designing Accessible UI**\n\nI\'m now focusing on accessibility by creating a UI overhaul. I\'m prioritizing high-contrast designs with large, readable fonts (16-20px) on neutral backgrounds. I am also aiming to offer clear tab navigation for itinerary views with large, intuitive buttons, and easy-to-read cards with clear labels. I will incorporate a text size toggle for ease of reading, and plan to add \"Fun Facts\" at the end of the itinerary.\n\n\n**Adding Visual Flair**\n\nI\'m now integrating captivating imagery. My current focus involves researching and implementing high-quality photographs for destination headers, landmark activities, hotel listings, and food items. The goal is to enhance user engagement with appealing visuals and smart image resolution. I plan on curating Unsplash images that exactly match destinations and food items. I also aim to include a high-resolution hero photo for each destination and specific photos for activities.\n\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 92800023
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
