  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Image Matching**\n\nI\'m focusing on the user\'s feedback regarding the image search. It seems the initial results were too generic. My current thinking revolves around building a much more precise image matching system that ties the visual search results directly to specific places or landmarks. I\'m aiming for targeted and relevant photos this time.\n\n\n**Expanding Image Scope**\n\nI\'ve been working on expanding the image scope. I\'ve integrated a verified landmark image database covering over 150 global and Indian landmarks. My approach now incorporates location-aware matching, leveraging both destination and landmark name. I\'m focusing on high-quality Unsplash photos with strategic keyword queries and fallbacks. I\'m also allowing the AI to return either `image_url` or `photo_query` directly in the payload to increase flexibility.\n\n\n**Developing Travel Resources**\n\nI\'m currently focused on improving the travel resource generation. I\'ve expanded the functionality to include flight duration calculations, direct and layover options, and key airline information. I\'m also working on providing estimated fare ranges and the best booking times. I\'m building direct links to Google Flights, Skyscanner, and Kayak. I am working on building more robust resources for hotels and food options, aiming for 6-8 hotel options and 8-10 food recommendations for each search.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 638530782
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
