        }
        lines {
          text: "          title: \"The Singing Floors of Nijo Castle\","
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "          fact: \"Nijo Castle\'s \'Nightingale floors\' (Uguisubari) were intentionally engineered with iron clamps underneath the planks that chirp like birds when walked on, alerting guards to any creeping assassins!\","
