  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the enhancements to the Smart Travel Planner, integrating global destinations, interactive mapping, flight analysis, and expanded recommendations within the Bento Grid aesthetic:\n\n- **Interactive Trip Map & Google Maps Integration**: Added an interactive map widget featuring day-by-day route paths, colored landmark pins, popups with photos and insider tips, one-click **\"Open Route in Google Maps\"**, and **Google My Maps (.kml)** export.\n- **Dedicated Flight Planning Page**: Built a comprehensive flight guide with departure hub selection, destination airport distance indicators, popular airline routes, direct flight badges, fare estimates (Economy & Business), and direct search shortcuts to Google Flights and Skyscanner.\n- **Expanded Stays & Dining (6\342\200\2238 Curated Recommendations)**: Upgraded both Hotel and Food sections to feature 6\342\200\2238 diverse places categorized by tier (Luxury, Boutique, Comfort, Budget) with dietary filters (Pure Veg, Veg-Friendly), neighborhood proximity, and one-click Google Maps links.\n- **Global Currency & Destination Adaptation**: Integrated multi-currency support across **USD ($)**, **INR (\342\202\271)**, **EUR (\342\202\254)**, **GBP (\302\243)**, **JPY (\302\245)**, and more, allowing travelers worldwide to plan itineraries in their local currency.\n- **Save Trip & Calendar Export**: Added browser-based trip saving with a **Saved Trips Manager** modal and downloadable **Google Calendar (.ics)** schedule files.\n- **Accurate Landmark & Culinary Visuals**: Linked high-precision, destination-matched landmark photography and authentic local dish imagery across all itinerary cards and tabs."
