  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved both issues with the dark mode toggle and tab switching:\n\n- **Dark Mode System Fix**: \n  - Configured `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));` in `index.css` for Tailwind CSS v4 to enable class-based dark mode control rather than relying solely on the operating system\'s media query.\n  - Linked the Sun/Moon toggle in the top navigation bar to persistent state management in `App.tsx`, defaulting to clean light mode while remembering user preferences in local storage.\n  \n- **Tab Navigation & Page Switching**:\n  - Restructured the view hierarchy so the **Tab Navigation Bar** is anchored directly above the dynamic content area with sticky docking and active tab status badges.\n  - Added smooth scroll positioning on tab click and dedicated page headers for each section (**Day-by-Day Plan**, **Interactive Map & Routes**, **Flights & Transit**, **Hotels & Stays**, **Food & Dining**, **Phrasebook & Dialect**, and **Tips & Logistics**)."
    modified_response: "I have resolved both issues with the dark mode toggle and tab switching:\n\n- **Dark Mode System Fix**: \n  - Configured `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));` in `index.css` for Tailwind CSS v4 to enable class-based dark mode control rather than relying solely on the operating system\'s media query.\n  - Linked the Sun/Moon toggle in the top navigation bar to persistent state management in `App.tsx`, defaulting to clean light mode while remembering user preferences in local storage.\n  \n- **Tab Navigation & Page Switching**:\n  - Restructured the view hierarchy so the **Tab Navigation Bar** is anchored directly above the dynamic content area with sticky docking and active tab status badges.\n  - Added smooth scroll positioning on tab click and dedicated page headers for each section (**Day-by-Day Plan**, **Interactive Map & Routes**, **Flights & Transit**, **Hotels & Stays**, **Food & Dining**, **Phrasebook & Dialect**, and **Tips & Logistics**)."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
