    response: "I have completed the final review and polish of the **Smart Itinerary Planner**:\n\n- **Defensive Data Safety & Error Prevention**: Applied universal fallback guards (`|| []` and schema field fallbacks) across all itinerary sections\342\200\224including `DayScheduleCard`, `SurvivalPhrasesSection`, `LogisticsGuideCard`, `CostBreakdownCard`, `HotelSection`, and `RestaurantSection`\342\200\224preventing any runtime undefined reference errors.\n- **Tab Navigation & Smooth Transitions**: Polished the responsive section tab bar with dedicated views for the Day-by-Day Schedule, Interactive Map & Waypoints, Flight Finder & Airport Transit, Hotels & Stays, Dining & Dietary Filters, Phrasebook Audio & Pronunciation, and Cultural Logistics.\n- **Map & Export Integrations**: Verified the Leaflet interactive map rendering, Google Maps multi-stop route generators, and Google Calendar event sync buttons.\n- **Verification**: Verified the codebase with `tsc --noEmit` and completed a full production build successfully."
